{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1431,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ddd62b5ffb475ec5ffd0d40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68e822021704de2d0b17450911975e3353a641db970893dc695ab5dee7eda4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4ffe018e245c1d0a13f0d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次，一定要登顶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fbf52f97283ca7f43575580bd329794590e137e16ebd962f87c2bb1db5fcb9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e5ef7c30e6db0430bd34fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还差一点…继续努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8bd12b2ea2926bc3564e00ab73e5fa4f731e46183cc63074130a5e66b7358e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:567cdc1d9fe65ea304cbe04c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明明是想回应大家的应援……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0097d029040af921db786d71361eb237c7777feb13ae27e27c3adf77c420e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c1b0c5c1010fd5e7a241dc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…期待落空了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6698dbd5ddb4649d38cccc5a179b77bfefd6a0b01504750961df5df88a972c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48e35293c5a43c1c0525f81d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是在大家的声援下\r\n被推动而获得的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7e6936d2679efba667a8af888c9f551ef17eaaaf86f640987dc1640541d37e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7be7cc6c9b1414c5490dc1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了…谢谢大家的应援！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eee83574d0442c5891bd29b244f441e3762c8b8523c909a0bd9e35ed0eba0a72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64bb4dd797257eb5d70346c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdea77b33aeaec916717deb674c10b49445b607aad8c9a51a8f916ddb616c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95b982c85f65b6c5963d6bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲过去！冲向顶点的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c944e4c659cb848406075b33ebaf2b22ace736965dda7fd4c26651b7d967054e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:800764a87b0fc0895cf7a1ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小歌剧说的话有点难懂呢…\r\n我还需要补习更多的歌剧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5531d3c6ac8fa4196771829a2630e7196ca856a7e986d3a795ff65cd4c0992e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a339b59992c1a1e38954b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从大家的期待中获得力量――\r\n冲过去！冲向顶点的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd5e6ae6c33ce7b4c9795334252e7c07f775b2d117d44cca1ed3c5836930a190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d6b6e780feb3fa4a56fc0f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后也想和她们继续竞争下去！\r\n而且，我一定会赢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19edfb5339e99c9a8af7ad9020b09bc229b3880843b963833b33fc9c47004e00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b3340e86a84c71036c769ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要报答大家的支持！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95dae9bb4cbf313eb446a82bc1cf6c0be31f99b1b9e0a96fd01209832248e0f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d795bde7f319652726ec59d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总之，先让气氛火热起来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a8cc06c773bb4c8721a3bb10efff758ec38f5c42783436054fa67fb56351f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36103a36800b6071cfe039c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一步一步地和你一起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7b74eaab9f63ab63e68f1490947f9f7b3b35cb74e10c37b0a4d1ea6dab1b741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc6c20d396b394c3cdb0612b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越跑越有这么个感觉，\r\n感觉训练员选中我的那一天，\r\n果然是很特别的日子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1c2690857343af70d0876a6e5228251d726de92af111685ff1596aa806666da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:583185e2c75e1d8d030b7dc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我是班长，\r\n所以必须保持仪容整洁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f246ac56411c12c7b74a1af4d38d9aab760c85a3d33f1bff503ce5afa3de72b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef8ec8a0f3392602dddc0ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为经常踢足球\r\n所以我很擅长跳舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e1e49560c1950456e650558ee476c1134edefd06556bfc887d94272b4fd52a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55601f6432c02b19aaba5404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到大家的期待…是这样的服装吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55b0d268494d618fe3575a2676e942f01e30c9d79f8ff0c03962a02fcb9db31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be808100dfd2dfc95f535fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都会穿，总感觉很漂亮呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5963cd0c067fa396b2dc73993f02ec014a4b9e325c0eefd219e600c2c181c9e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca64550b23e039a51dd07abe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛还是live\r\n我都想回应大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bcdad2b7aa00d85daae77b3e8964c59f0d0e4d6560bd6624a3bee365e588ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a7a8cf2fbc0a45055f59f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到我所背负的东西\r\n力量就会不断涌上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1544966d3b7235d0621476458d7792c8bb27833ac6011dfd7b602e9c28520d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3807a3418b220aa6637312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，衣服换好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd23ccfc456c504534197d4ee913bb80f361396a78e7fe55639576f46c60262a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f03e9a82c002dbdc57a42f89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃，是不是变得有点不检点了…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c422055d3a33de2aaa5c246f63c1e21c5dbfd80ec6b4477b8e05ae7c7986fb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acdcfb49e98269b1e8189a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学園の中で着ていると\r\n少し不思議な感じがしますね…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eef140e293ad7672592a93439a90fadf14681fd74c3c8e469f1defeb50517c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64b3bdb9c42675965603ef1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "少し、外を歩いてこようかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74d7cd899dc4e8bcd2f5961eb7d0d9b6f41065dd7506e6c780b4ff08c0001d8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae70a853e106761938a0c0f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我是班长，\r\n所以必须保持仪容整洁！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f246ac56411c12c7b74a1af4d38d9aab760c85a3d33f1bff503ce5afa3de72b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cb219e2735dc12bf0971567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为经常踢足球\r\n所以我很擅长跳舞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2e1e49560c1950456e650558ee476c1134edefd06556bfc887d94272b4fd52a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a54b2e148df285e7e2d84f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受到大家的期待…是这样的服装吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f55b0d268494d618fe3575a2676e942f01e30c9d79f8ff0c03962a02fcb9db31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6fa4a5ed69b0e6a597aaa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每天都会穿，总感觉很漂亮呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5963cd0c067fa396b2dc73993f02ec014a4b9e325c0eefd219e600c2c181c9e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50d8e83e9cfb43b4e1efd92d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛还是live\r\n我都想回应大家的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01bcdad2b7aa00d85daae77b3e8964c59f0d0e4d6560bd6624a3bee365e588ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0b826357a160b2460a10f90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感受到我所背负的东西\r\n力量就会不断涌上来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1544966d3b7235d0621476458d7792c8bb27833ac6011dfd7b602e9c28520d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de87ad949307f1b19cb42a65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，衣服换好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd23ccfc456c504534197d4ee913bb80f361396a78e7fe55639576f46c60262a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5263e20ad5c235e4e4b2bd85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃，是不是变得有点不检点了…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c422055d3a33de2aaa5c246f63c1e21c5dbfd80ec6b4477b8e05ae7c7986fb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f940361cbfcdaddd5fc84649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您辛苦了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc192cb6ce9ec4802719955792407214f43bcf4d45dca0cd0a57e6192c3ea3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f37f807d78b339dbc0c8f7a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n早晨的活力来源于训练！\r\n今天我也跑了很多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e12e6e695e8a4dde37a9d70043fdf6751c49770aeae45bb19796b187fdc2c1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba6d163e1985e5ce44a43fb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上跑步的话，\r\n身体就会轻松一整天！\r\n难道说这就是健康的秘诀吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd910d8c2982ddd773754c66a038405a136a702b87652098da597ee77158a384",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ec2c940f2ce3b9229e47ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下午的训练我很期待！\r\n我相信我能和训练员一起成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "571d5a21c333801726d79c452f80bfea8924124ff9f675ea3b497175606f242b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a0ba94c9bf3bdf3485815e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为班长的工作，中午经常会来迟\r\n但是！能被大家依赖到这种程度我很荣幸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1872c38a91ab7998e571abe94c7c9f3ff1a9b9dcb0b66a6b559aae4c21ff9c73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7a16a391d776a33cc03664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈调香的精油，\r\n放在枕头旁边就能安然入睡！\r\n我自己调香的就有点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e493ee380ba6c92cb819299c7ee09f0c4b0eae5e8429c8307a3bf9c0392a6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd65fa97beeaf15a7a184d18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～…啊，对不起！\r\n因为起得很早，\r\n一到晚上马上就困了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e90d5b59c37d7db0dca43cf83e21ac8ebb946734e8a4f3235ed97a9989c178cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565518816f5394b16bcf2179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天天气容易变得不好。\r\n为了不耽误训练\r\n要不要做个晴天娃娃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6fe793943d4703fa4357f7125f2426fc85e3c21126b6aa986270155dc2426a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e07c356bcf8b1575f5a10bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在酷暑时节流了很多汗，\r\n很有成长了的感觉！\r\n满足感一下子就涌上来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46e3d6e18f84ab57df9228538c651317c9186ba503c351d9b68f0b07aff48808",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e005bbc6b3094bff1cf411a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正值运动之秋！所以\r\n周末我要和小奇宝她们\r\n一起去室内足球场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2096ed1f1110ea8ad82a334f0ee0922ecb5bbc41aec3ba101ea5a59ce9eb0a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b26e69da240d081b7e9cbc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天从被窝里钻出来都很辛苦了，\r\n但是…打开窗户呼吸新鲜空气的瞬间，\r\n我一点也不讨厌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b81bd57137897b63853bfd4a2e05e7173dfc62f61b4a06a51f4dd320524324",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e62e6d87c57fb8d2da92aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88bb89362e30d3f2eeb76274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小宝穴早上好像很难起床……\r\n每天晨训以后去叫醒她，\r\n已经变成日常了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4017ba9f31042d9b6711f8f17f873d493421014992641417db738a7ef63206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0273f7e9324409aaaf117e51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…不注意的话\r\n就容易擦出小伤口…\r\n得保持冷静才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54ded443295746278e123bf82e746dc10228b228e72a562d0109be7459d19c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48356870331b283f4b3dd011",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才跑步的时候\r\n被乌鸦包围了…好一阵子\r\n身体僵硬地动都动不了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "029fc49c8784b00099fb034f77436725a00f4b5c5584657d5cdf1c0149520221",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f471738affd8a1eb75bd6b2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果被纸割伤了手指的话，\r\n爱织同学会给我创可贴！\r\n还是小羊图案的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9d8a3f131d00325715da07bc2df3f9cf8cd72de49a28d87ad5ceb27512895f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1518309debe46c7b06272a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候我会被叫去当小歌剧的翻译，\r\n说实话我倒觉得没有那么难理解…",
      "source_fingerprint": "988c3a8168d7f9a4f55657f010af5a668e1dee596606350f462f0a8497bd6740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24255ce905504c01e639662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在live的舞台上移动\r\n有时候需要转一个大圈…\r\n得格外小心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e6f052a340c31487db6860c515830a61c63cadf3ee1e3a914fa8e0034373e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3834838ef2cf92ea05cd6b10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上听到大家的欢呼声、\r\n想要回应这个应援\r\n变得更有干劲了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a230182266d1387f33bfdf867a4270446bd4bfbc50db56b193ce353a7db49ab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbe29c3e068eb2e93ddbb8ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张时会不由自主地抓住衣服下摆\r\n…不能穿着皱皱巴巴的衣服站在舞台上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b780752a960abeb69c01a8aa850648be7ea1631d8edcb727345df445eaacc56d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9ee2ee030cf20832e25c408",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这身决胜服就意味着\r\n要背负起大家的期待！\r\n我，绝对会赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea6fce85fd9cecb2b8d0a9c1cf4f18cc4f876780b7fb8f0e6c202490e6cd9d59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60357d2e104fccceba730e60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上要稍微早点到校！\r\n收笔记，还有打开教室窗户通风\r\n作为班长可是有很多工作的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec6e9a84c7986dd814627c125fbfde13742362755915b922284e126b6f485c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81ad05429abcb3ad37f0aa0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助餐厅的胡萝卜色拉\r\n我最喜欢了！\r\n不知不觉每天都会点～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "699d93ac31951248c71f50a5f9c30cc7d9b7dfb3bfa5bfbd68cc01b87f82433b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17f5d4de53bd2e0788a77e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上有时候有机会\r\n会跟爱织同学一起跑步…\r\n那时候的星空真美呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36fdf9e367420b2527b47fcf863d9de601a12cbd8a737f57444e57ead9955bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91bdf8b210f20609fb028915",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，新生们崭新的制服真好啊！\r\n有关宿舍生活的咨询什么的希望能帮上她们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04689664621b2f4b641918188d357aa64a5a2b089f239d4456aa7f1dabe75564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30487112cc9216adc2e4eec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种浑身冒汗的感觉我很喜欢！\r\n这才有夏天的实感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a933f52147338d27145f416861b057137b8db6fd6e67b430c3e6a388b348789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5798a1bca85572d2c97f2cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就不得不提运动了！\r\n我爸爸开的体育用品店里面，\r\n有一个我推荐商品的展示柜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f9eb904b371307bb3498766a985aabb30c6717e0ca99cc0906f146987be0856",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e2fdcd8ab3893d8f1e6ebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在冬天早晨晨练，\r\n身体慢慢变暖的瞬间很舒服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ccb102a6aba859d82b3760f29a5a6ebae07aea92bcc99f54bcd5f0a34e04f27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10ca30f8d02c574b4cf67dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流下的汗水是不会骗人的！\r\n所以今天也要全力训练，\r\n请多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f8dfe2be6c091a856d756dd011b5353d7f3cb68fd1a52adce0d80679cb1e4a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7b67eb02d96b26f2cf3904",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張ります！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce668c40f253d10781168301572643428e336fa5787539b1a44cdadbef25cec7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:615c7fe3fca21b4ed748689f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信这样的积累一定会带来胜利！\r\n一定能跑出不辜负期待的样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20d6352f9702daafaa4adb15137742bf264d620699ca80c074f5b617d73e0281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14048d34e48c0137dc441020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起，我赶上了吗！？\r\n因为班上有事，\r\n稍微来晚了一些！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b255110e1b91c802dffd87f45dcc9a341b307343e14ba4bf404edbdd789c6bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6d33a462473958ca0c39718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用多虑，\r\n请多多安排锻炼内容！\r\n毕竟这也是为了成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8743001813deffc63c71df03ea564f133b7910ef3e7bd424e83177d6ed06f4f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ee4b47da50df835c45789e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备运动已经结束了！\r\n可以一起训练吗？\r\n我等不及了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a234ea9074f980d5d93dfd65175295048a03d8540a7cb1a24989b7cb77a9ec4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f181e155d3630b40173666",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不断地努力还有训练员的好点子，\r\n都是我支撑我跑下去的自信来源！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6456d7281d9a85b94353a749f91a855d9702f09156719970b63a5083ca795ff5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f21d803fc4551435996b950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我说话和跑步都很不灵光…\r\n所以请让我用独一无二的胜利回赠给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "728d2290a23a04ed1aab49cf7dd2449f0ba2f5f976b7d2e4748d39e1bb69e35a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30fbf16ff7c657bf79b4f787",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好强的阳光啊！\r\n但是我是不会输的！\r\n太阳公公也请看好吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a03899f3d11a2f40a1d246fbf90f92975da91d94810cc467cd2669702a3a3424",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58158ebddbb63bf878cd13b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起奔向顶点的道路，我永远不会忘记！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ca369210dbd8c2c665dcbbb9c7527bcd6869f7627593809ece99e64fe9037b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9876887fa3cd09c38ed40f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "十分满意的成果！谢谢大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3e07678f6f7afa9279ad314576ab1edb2a3554a18ceae7a69c0a385df91984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d537ac5385ecffb15dc6ea07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要回应大家的期待…要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e57ba4565728bae5b7fea853a5b95c5695f6b44d3ed3133f5ea81880eea08a29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ac50ec05ad0eeb6c72c246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是，\r\n每天辛苦流汗的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c328c3921041ba8515b1e8d3dc0832d8f5c7320499e14ac479da1eb9a11cea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d7583ddec66b0955cb30ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是成田路！\r\n请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "541496d252c4b13e8cda66cb67055f8eac6736025325c8ac919c959d38768793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:188968e25497400251189be8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在是通往遥远顶点的道路\r\n如果和你一起的话，一定能行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfae2e008f9d996818e6a71074916c74b88d7197670020d5e742db6b41e76ebd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec037bb9a9dd44e45829a784",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像还能助我一臂之力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6225f5f25de952c2568d7937af4ad846dde7229b1ed3576343a2bb39065d0c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:256fbd8e952ae66271020e7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会回应大家的期待的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "034365cb55a0d742c51606e8f2e6e980c50b2d8250305410e763477180c06024",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1077",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e930b5b6cedd59da076a16a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带着风一起……",
      "source_fingerprint": "13f09c1a72a4f48385e1a7d7bb928e85bcbd5cca82e40b5b41270d150700de8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1078",
        "1000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
